.TH QUIPU-FORK-PROMOTE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-fork\-promote \- Promote a fork to ROOT, with reviewable conflict decisions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fork promote\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-\-emit\-decisions\fR] [\fB\-\-decisions\fR] [\fB\-\-reviewer\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-propose\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIname\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Promote a fork to ROOT, with reviewable conflict decisions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Valid\-time timestamp for the operation
.TP
\fB\-\-emit\-decisions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Write merge decisions to this file
.TP
\fB\-\-decisions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Conflict decisions file
.TP
\fB\-\-reviewer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Identity reviewing the merge
.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Actor recorded in operation provenance
.TP
\fB\-\-propose\fR
Produce a merge proposal without applying it
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview the operation without applying it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIname\fR>

